WEBVTT

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:33.440
"Circlet Night"?

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.000
It's a festival to wish 
for the peace of the city

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:36.540
Going Beyond the Limit

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.530
that will be held for two 
days over the weekend.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:40.130
That sounds like fun.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.460
Instructor, do you like festivals?

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.670
Hmm, can't really say.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:49.000
Jeez, what's wrong with just telling me?!

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.210
You know my body in and out,

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:55.670
so it's quite unfair that I know hardly
anything about you, Instructor!

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.330
M-Milady...

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:59.710
Well, that's the truth.

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:09.790
To be honest, I don't know 
much about festivals.

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:10.480
Huh?

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:12.880
I do hail from the land of 
eternal night, after all.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:16.240
You mean the lower-social-stratum 
living quarters?

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:18.420
Further out beyond there.

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:20.750
Rather than saying I lived there,

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:23.450
it was more like I somehow 
managed to survive there.

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.830
O-oh, I see.

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:29.540
Anyway, what's with that dress?

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.170
Ah, right.

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.630
This is the costume for 
the festival's parade.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:38.830
All the St. Friedeswiede's students will
wear it and join in a parade, you see.

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:40.840
Please try it on and let me have a look.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.670
I-I can't do that!

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.290
For a long time now,

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:49.290
I've looked forward to wearing the
same outfit as Elli and joining the parade,

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.630
so I don't want to spoil the big day.

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:54.750
Oh, is that right?

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:57.040
That sounds nice, milady.

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:58.080
Yeah!

00:02:59.380 --> 00:02:59.920
Um...

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:01.950
Instructor...

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:04.040
Is something the matter?

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:07.210
I-if it is alright with you,

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:10.000
wh-when they have the campfire...

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.880
I was thinking I'd really like 
for you to dance with me...

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:16.290
I'm afraid I can't.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:18.790
Due to a commitment related 
to a previous assignment,

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:21.830
I must return to the Holy Monarch District.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:23.140
Huh?

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:25.540
Is that so?

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:26.880
However...

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:29.380
I'll be able to come back 
on the festival's final day.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:33.210
So would you do me the pleasure
of dancing with me then?

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:37.460
I'll be sure to keep my hand open
so that it's ready for you to take!

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.540
Oh my, what an honor.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:46.330
Your performance at the match the
other day was most splendid.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:53.210
Milady, the masters of the
house were also most pleased.

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:55.790
Yes. I'm happy.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.920
However...

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:01.130
you were in a bit too much of 
a rush to clinch the match.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.780
Had you given Lady Melida a sound beating and

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:07.130
made her kneel before you 
with the spectators watching,

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:10.630
which of you is worthy of being the legitimate
successor of the House of Angel

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:14.000
would have been clear for everyone to see.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.850
Mrs. Othello.

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.210
A costume has arrived from the academy.

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:23.330
Ah, must be the one for the festival.

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:28.480
Dear me!

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:31.790
What in the world is this 
shabby piece of cloth?!

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:35.420
We certainly cannot allow Lady 
Elise to wear such a rag!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.630
We shall prepare a new costume for you.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:43.380
One that will make it easy for us to
show you aren't like the other children!

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:51.040
Melida, over here!

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.250
How beautiful!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.540
This cloth is made from flame-bird feathers!

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:03.060
And that gem is a fire-starter stone!

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:06.130
Lady Elise, where did you get that outfit?

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:09.460
My family had it made for me.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.960
What do you think of that?

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:15.250
I don't care whether she comes
from a Knight-Duke House or not.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:19.540
These are precious costumes that've been
handed down by our seniors at this school,

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.500
but it seems even that doesn't matter to her!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.960
No! Elli isn't self-centered like that!

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:29.720
Lady Elise, where are you going?

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:31.500
Elli...

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.830
I'd been wanting to wear it...

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:39.830
I'd been looking forward to it...

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:43.420
I can't stand being the 
only one wearing this.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.920
If only I could've worn what I wanted...!

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.500
Elli...

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:52.540
Elli...?

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.170
E-Elli...

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:56.750
Um...

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.210
What?!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.210
Who the hell are you guys?!

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:05.250
Do I look like Prince Charming?

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:10.420
You...

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:13.330
Lita!

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:16.000
NOO!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:23.500
Wh-what is this...?

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:25.380
Wh-where am I?

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:27.400
Oh, you're awake.

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:29.530
You're that guy from before!

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:34.540
It's no use.

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.460
You're a lancanthrope, aren't you?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.210
Why're you hanging around with humans?!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.830
Say, you're not a Paladin, are you?

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.330
Despite being a member of the
Knight-Duke House of Angel...

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:52.050
Wh-what're you talking about?

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:54.130
I'm a human, you know.

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:57.250
Well, I am half-lancanthrope, though.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:01.420
A being reborn as an artificial lancanthrope

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:04.540
when a certain organization transplanted
the night gene-factor into him

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:08.420
in the hope of obtaining the
power to compete with mana users...

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:10.030
That's what I am.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:13.790
By the way, our organization
goes by the name "Guild Grimfice."

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:15.830
Heard of us?

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.410
Wh-why me?!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:22.630
You used your power in a flashy
way during that match the other day.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:28.630
Elli!

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.290
Whoa now, Melida Angel.

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:36.010
I am going to forcibly mutate 
your class to Paladin.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:40.130
I will transplant Elise 
Angel's ability into you.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.860
That said, the success rate is low,

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:46.610
and even if it goes well you might 
end up tantamount to a cripple.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.920
This place is a museum...?

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:58.500
This whole area has been blocked
off by members of the guild,

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.040
so no one will be coming to your rescue.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:04.170
That'd be hard for someone without
connections to a Knight-Duke House...

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:06.380
Father...?!

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:10.710
Elli!

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:12.540
I see you're finally awake!

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:15.380
People with sheltered upbringings
lack a sense of danger, huh?

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:18.420
No!

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:19.250
NO!

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:19.920
Elli...
NO!

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:20.130
NO!

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:22.830
NOOO!

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:26.040
I'm scared.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.080
You're alright, Elli.

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:32.290
I'm right here next to you.

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:37.920
That's why I knew that 
I had to become strong.

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:39.330
And yet...

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.570
Hey, hold her down!

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:43.580
No! Stay back!

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.290
How weak of me to have been
waiting for Elli to save me!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.800
I'm going to protect Elli!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.800
What in the world are ya doing?

00:08:56.800 --> 00:09:01.460
No matter how much noise you make,
there's nobody anywhere around here, remember?

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.880
Elli, this way!

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.910
Looks like there's an emergency
exit toward the back of Area No. 3.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.130
Let's go.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.380
Don't cry, Elli!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.580
But, it's all so...

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.960
Look, I'm right here next to you!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:29.830
Okay?

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.580
Yeah.

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:34.710
Alright!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.920
Hey, those are weapons, right?

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:42.080
But, I don't feel a divine 
nature coming from any of them.

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.960
I don't think they'll work 
against lancanthropes.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.920
We can't use our mana.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:51.170
So getting our hands on weapons that
have a divine nature would be nice.

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:53.980
Oh, I know!

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.380
Sorry about this, Elli!

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:56.070
Lita...?

00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:58.460
Ah, that's right.

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:01.040
This dress has fabric made from flame-birds.

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:04.250
My tutor taught me something:

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:07.920
"Keep in mind all the possible options your
surroundings offer when you fight.

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:12.290
Do whatever's necessary to survive,
even if it means tearing the world apart."

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.580
I'll be borrowing this, too.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:20.880
The fire-starter stone and flame-bird
feathers are imbued with a divine nature.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:22.670
So, if we use this...

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:25.420
Lita!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:31.080
Lita!

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:58.300
Get away from Elli!

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:01.000
Here! I'll give you a taste of this, too!

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:03.380
Your eyeballs are wide open to attack!

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:11.960
The likes of you all don't 
scare me a bit anymore!

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.080
Lita, that was amazing.

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:18.400
Y-you haven't seen anything yet!

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:20.630
Ah, there's the emergency exit!

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:24.370
You're a shockingly tough 
little princess, aren't you?

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:26.960
Hey, Melida.

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:30.670
Here I am offering to make you a Paladin,
so why're you running?

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:34.660
I already have the same respectable
Class as my instructor!

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:36.210
I don't need what you offer!

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:42.710
You're out of your league.

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:47.220
Lita!

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:52.240
Don't try to put up a fight.

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:56.080
I actually find holding back enough
to not kill you rather difficult.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:03.630
Lita...

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:08.120
You girls...

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.880
Change of plans.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:21.500
We're going to dispose 
of these two right here.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:22.250
B-but...!

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:24.420
If we let them live,

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:28.020
there's no question they'll become
a threat to us in the near future.

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:31.310
There was no expectation for them
to survive the procedure anyway.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.690
We can think up an excuse.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.320
Bye now.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.380
Sorry we took so long, milady.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:05.080
I received a message from my guild as I
was traveling and hurried back here.

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:07.220
You all, say your prayers!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.920
Forget the kids - kill those knights!

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:16.580
Rose!

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:25.360
Scarlet Phoenix: Kagura.

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:28.880
Elle Adora Avalanche!

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:44.590
Amazing...

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:46.380
This feeling...

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:47.830
This sense of unity...

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:49.630
Is a first for me.

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:51.670
Please see to the young ladies.

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:52.670
Ah, wai-!

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:54.460
Jeez!

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:03.960
I suspected it was you.

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:05.280
Yeah.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.500
Well, you were given the job
first but you've left it undone,

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:10.990
which is probably why my 
guild was mobilized, right?

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.880
Just as I thought, Lord 
Mordrew is behind this...

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:17.630
I won't allow you to keep meddling
in the young ladies' affairs.

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:33.920
This is our trump card.

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:50.750
That thing's...

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:56.040
A man-made lancanthrope...

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.880
"Haunted Chimera."

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:00.000
The development concept was,

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.040
"a monster that humans are 
absolutely no match for."

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:07.830
The secret to that lies in maxing 
out all of its abilities.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:12.210
Well then, let's pick up from 
where we left off last time.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.880
I see you're as quick as ever!

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:20.540
Same goes for you.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:24.960
What bothersome bandages...

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:26.830
Over there, huh?!

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:29.070
You reacted well, but...

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:37.210
Ultimate Unsheathing...

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.290
Radiant-Night War-Storm!

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:50.880
You damned monster!

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.210
You finally left yourself open to attack.

00:15:58.210 --> 00:16:00.250
I won't be letting you use any mana.

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:13.830
Ah, humans are so fragile...

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:24.460
You got a blow in, huh?

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.130
I thought I had sealed off your mana...

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:30.420
Nevertheless...

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:35.750
You no longer have any future as a warrior.

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:39.420
Is that girl really worth all 
you've done to protect her?

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:41.000
I believe so.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:43.960
Sooner or later milady will surpass me,

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:46.250
defeat every last fierce fighter around,

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:48.750
and come to stand atop all of Flandore.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:53.170
Although previously disdained as an
"incompetent talented girl,"

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:57.450
her gallant figure will become a source of hope
for all those who lead thankless existences.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:01.330
And thus, here I stand.

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:05.130
Risking my life, I WILL nurture that girl!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.250
You felt it too, didn't you?

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:09.860
In that case.

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:14.420
I can't waste any time crushing
the both of you at all costs!

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:30.420
In the end, he didn't even make a move, huh?

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:35.200
Well, I'm feeling better now.

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.960
Next, it's time to go kill Meli-

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.000
Ridiculous!

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.250
That thing is fully maxed out!

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.500
There's no way a human could rival it!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.720
"Maxed out," huh?

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.870
Sorry to say, but...

00:17:57.870 --> 00:18:00.130
I'm currently breaking the limits!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:35.080
What the...?

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:46.630
Impossible!

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:48.270
Don't tell me that power is...

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:56.250
A vampire!

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:03.990
What's the strongest type of lancanthrope
doing in a place like this?!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.540
I'm also half human.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.540
Much like you, I'm not fully one thing.

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:17.300
Relax, I'm not going to kill you.

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:18.960
Wh-what?!

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:23.540
You were attempting to mutate 
Melida Angel's Class.

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:27.670
However, just before you tried it,
she exhibited Paladin-like power.

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:32.710
And, with that, it's virtually confirmed that
she's a descendant of a Knight-Duke House.

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:38.080
"Just how would Melida Angel's life or
death affect your own position?

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:43.170
After giving it ample thought,
consider your future course of action."

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:45.380
Pass that on to your client.

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:46.620
You got that?

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:49.040
U-understood.

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:50.460
Alright.

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:01.170
Do you really intend to train Melida Angel
into the ultimate warrior?

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:06.130
If that girl fully develops,
it might be you who becomes the hunted!

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:14.500
If that time comes, I will 
gladly stick out my neck.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:25.210
This is a report on the act of terror
recently carried out by Guild Grimfice.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:31.250
There's quite a lot in it 
that's hard to make sense of.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.250
Black Madia.

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:37.960
Make contact with Melida Angel, who's at
the center of this, as well as Kufa Vampir,

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:41.330
and find out what it is they're hiding.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:50.390
If he turned down the mission, 
shall I take him down?

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:03.140
Looks like a fun carnival is about to begin.

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:07.790
Huh?! My father, you say?!

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:08.880
Yes.

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:12.380
He noticed something off with the way the
stationing of the guards had changed,

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:15.790
and he assisted in determining 
the location of you girls.

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:30.670
Milady, may I have the 
pleasure of this dance?

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:33.830
Yes!

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:40.440
Instructor...

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:45.210
how long will you keep on being my tutor?

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:47.880
What's this all of a sudden?

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:54.580
I feel like it's not natural for you to be
at the side of someone like me.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:56.830
But...

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:01.080
I want to be together with 
you forever, Instructor!

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:04.220
Right now, I'm still a 
little lady, but one day

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:07.350
I'll stand by your side as 
a lady who's worthy of you!

00:22:07.350 --> 00:22:08.130
That's why...

00:22:09.420 --> 00:22:12.040
I want you to wait for me, you see...

00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:22.630
Rest easy, milady.

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:25.190
That's what I'm here for.

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:29.660
I will lead you to far 
greater heights than these.

00:22:30.420 --> 00:22:32.250
You have not a thing to worry about.

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:38.290
And that's because I can say with pride:

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:40.960
You are my pupil.

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:40.830
Next Episode
Two Young Ladies Assemble at the Chained Castle
